# Fast check + time estimate

## Speed

- Simple check / “kyun ho raha hai” / e2e verify: **~3 minutes** target — direct cause pe jao, lamba exploration mat ghumao.
- Pehle sabse likely file/path kholo (e.g. live `sw.js`, API route, click handler). Guess-loops aur parallel rabbit holes avoid karo jab seedha evidence mil sakta ho.

## Agar time lag raha ho

- **Turant bolo** — chhupa ke mat chalte raho.
- Short update do: kya check ho raha hai + **estimate** (e.g. “abhi 5–10 min lagenge, X/Y pending”).
- Agar 3 min me clear answer/fix nahi aa raha: explicitly likho **“time lag raha hai”** + naya estimate + blocker kya hai.

## Fix vs check

- Bug clear ho to **turant fix**, phir short verify — hours tak “checking” mat karo.
- User ko har turn pe roughly batao: abhi kitna time / kab tak done.
